and that is not distributed with this product:

  - Ollama and the local model weights it serves (for example Llama 3.2),
    each under its own licence and model terms.
  - The agent-browser CLI, installed on demand by "local-ai.cmd web install"
    into an ignored local tool directory, under its own licence.
  - Microsoft Edge, reused from the host system by the browser QA lane, under
    its own licence.
  - OpenCode, used as the optional interactive coding harness, under its own
    licence.

